WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:18.098
could tell they'd landed in First City, though he didn't recognize the area.

2
00:00:18.699 --> 00:00:23.521
A light green rain was falling, casting a lime-tinted glow over the whole scene.

3
00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:25.122
"Where are we?"

4
00:00:25.582 --> 00:00:26.242
Gliss asked.

5
00:00:26.262 --> 00:00:30.064
"Edgewood," Saffa said, sounding perplexed.

6
00:00:30.792 --> 00:00:34.254
"It's a neighborhood on the far northern border of First City.

7
00:00:34.994 --> 00:00:37.315
But why did you bring us here, Wyssa?"

8
00:00:38.356 --> 00:00:39.796
Zann wondered the same thing.

9
00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:44.439
He realized that it was probably too risky to use the palace wormhole right now.

10
00:00:45.059 --> 00:00:47.600
But why wouldn't Wyssa bring them out in Wormwood?

11
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.861
After all, she used to live there.

12
00:00:49.881 --> 00:00:53.163
"There's no time for idle chitchat."

13
00:00:53.683 --> 00:00:54.823
Wyssa snapped her fingers.

14
00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.862
"Zap!" This time Zann recognized the spot where Wyssa had taken them.

15
00:01:01.882 --> 00:01:03.042
"The zoo?"

16
00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:07.045
he said, staring at a pair of nibblers in an enclosure nearby.

17
00:01:07.065 --> 00:01:08.726
"Why are we here?"

18
00:01:08.746 --> 00:01:12.888
"Are we going to borrow a dragon to ride to the Far Frontier?"

19
00:01:13.068 --> 00:01:13.688
Darb asked.

20
00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:17.671
Gliss glanced toward the dragon pen with a nervous expression.

21
00:01:18.231 --> 00:01:21.213
"The dragons here aren't very tame."

22
00:01:21.933 --> 00:01:23.314
Wyssa didn't seem to be listening.

23
00:01:24.054 --> 00:01:27.156
She peered through the green rain, which was falling harder now.

24
00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.681
"My errand here won't take long."

25
00:01:31.821 --> 00:01:34.822
Saffa stepped toward the zoo entrance, looking restless.

26
00:01:35.402 --> 00:01:37.623
"We should check on Venna," she said.

27
00:01:37.643 --> 00:01:40.523
"She might have been taken prisoner by now."

28
00:01:40.543 --> 00:01:43.524
"There's no time for that," Wyssa said.

29
00:01:43.544 --> 00:01:46.845
"We need to find Morb before he gathers more power!"

30
00:01:46.865 --> 00:01:52.247
"The election is less than a month away," Saffa said, sounding stubborn.

31
00:01:52.947 --> 00:01:57.448
"If things get any worse, it could be a disaster for all of Magica."

32
00:01:58.588 --> 00:02:00.669
Zann wasn't too worried about the election.

33
00:02:01.309 --> 00:02:03.911
But Saffa's words had reminded him of his parents.

34
00:02:03.931 --> 00:02:07.332
"We should check on the prisoners too," he said.

35
00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:09.753
"Yes!" Gliss exclaimed.

36
00:02:09.773 --> 00:02:12.174
"I want to see my uncle."

37
00:02:13.075 --> 00:02:13.835
Wyssa sighed.

38
00:02:13.855 --> 00:02:15.936
"Go," she said.

39
00:02:15.956 --> 00:02:18.177
"Make sure they're all okay.

40
00:02:18.717 --> 00:02:20.018
I'll wait for you here."

41
00:02:20.878 --> 00:02:21.939
Zann looked at the others.

42
00:02:22.679 --> 00:02:24.500
Could they trust Wyssa?

43
00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:28.643
Or would she take off for the Far Frontier on her own as soon as they zapped away?

44
00:02:28.663 --> 00:02:34.568
"Wyssa, we might need your help getting into the palace," Saffa said.

45
00:02:35.209 --> 00:02:36.469
Wyssa didn't look happy.

46
00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.152
But she agreed to go to the palace with them.

47
00:02:39.172 --> 00:02:41.794
"We have to hurry," she said.

48
00:02:42.594 --> 00:02:43.855
Everyone joined hands.

49
00:02:44.876 --> 00:02:49.620
Zap! They landed at the edge of the palace square.

50
00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:55.063
It was still raining, and Zann had to wipe water from his face before he could see clearly.

51
00:02:55.743 --> 00:02:57.904
When he did, his eyes widened.

52
00:02:59.065 --> 00:03:01.166
The square looked much different than usual.

53
00:03:01.866 --> 00:03:07.770
Dozens of guards were marching around, all of them wearing that new dark uniform they'd seen on the

54
00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:08.750
guards in the dungeon.

55
00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:11.332
"What's that all about?"

56
00:03:11.752 --> 00:03:12.392
Saffa muttered.

57
00:03:12.412 --> 00:03:13.833
"Who knows?"

58
00:03:14.273 --> 00:03:14.773
Perda said.

59
00:03:14.793 --> 00:03:19.156
"Maybe we can figure out a way to sneak in without the guards seeing us."

60
00:03:20.236 --> 00:03:21.617
"We don't have time for that."

61
00:03:22.117 --> 00:03:23.258
Saffa sounded impatient.

62
00:03:23.278 --> 00:03:25.739
"This is still Magica, isn't it?

63
00:03:26.299 --> 00:03:30.782
We have the right to visit the palace anytime we like without fearing imprisonment.

64
00:03:31.542 --> 00:03:33.223
I'm tired of sneaking around!"

65
00:03:33.243 --> 00:03:35.104
"But—" Zann began.

66
00:03:35.524 --> 00:03:36.245
It was too late.

67
00:03:36.845 --> 00:03:38.886
Saffa was already marching toward the main entrance.

68
00:03:39.747 --> 00:03:41.008
"Should we go with her?"

69
00:03:41.448 --> 00:03:42.068
Gliss asked.

70
00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:47.351
"No." Wyssa snapped her fingers, and a glowing wall appeared in front of them.

71
00:03:48.372 --> 00:03:50.097
"Hey." Zann was annoyed.

72
00:03:50.117 --> 00:03:52.558
"You can't stop us with a Shield spell."

73
00:03:52.578 --> 00:03:55.900
"It's for your own good," Wyssa said.

74
00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.981
Just then Darb poked Zann on the shoulder.

75
00:03:59.001 --> 00:04:02.783
"Look!" Saffa had reached the closest group of guards.

76
00:04:03.584 --> 00:04:06.465
While the kids watched, she appeared to argue with the guards.

77
00:04:07.206 --> 00:04:09.527
A moment later a guard clapped his hands.

78
00:04:10.207 --> 00:04:12.268
A large bubble enclosed Saffa!

79
00:04:12.949 --> 00:04:15.670
She yelled and struggled to get out, but it was no use.

80
00:04:16.451 --> 00:04:18.692
The bubble was already floating toward the palace.

81
00:04:19.936 --> 00:04:22.837
"No!" Zann blurted out, louder than he'd meant to.

82
00:04:23.497 --> 00:04:25.438
His voice attracted the attention of a guard.

83
00:04:26.058 --> 00:04:29.639
The guard turned and peered toward them, his face suspicious.

84
00:04:30.379 --> 00:04:32.119
Zann felt panic flash through him.

85
00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:36.801
If they all ended up in the dungeon, there was no way they'd be able to stop Morb!

86
00:04:38.081 --> 00:04:40.782
He grabbed Perda with one hand and Darb with the other.

87
00:04:40.802 --> 00:04:42.822
"Zap!" he yelled.

88
00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:49.024
Splash! They landed in a deep puddle in the gutter outside Teplo's house.

89
00:04:49.916 --> 00:04:52.617
Zann glanced around to make sure his friends were there.

90
00:04:53.418 --> 00:04:57.279
Perda, Gliss, and Darb were there, but someone else wasn't.

91
00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:59.140
"Where's Wyssa?"

92
00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:00.221
Perda asked.

93
00:05:00.241 --> 00:05:02.642
"I don't know," Zann said.

94
00:05:02.662 --> 00:05:04.583
"I guess she didn't zap with us."

95
00:05:05.963 --> 00:05:08.384
Gliss glanced up and down the street nervously.

96
00:05:08.404 --> 00:05:12.986
"We should get out of sight while we decide how to find her."

97
00:05:14.327 --> 00:05:16.128
Moments later they were in the hatch.

98
00:05:17.872 --> 00:05:20.773
Zing danced around Darb's head, shooting happy flames.

99
00:05:21.814 --> 00:05:23.294
Fala seemed relieved to see them.

100
00:05:23.314 --> 00:05:25.095
"Where's Saffa?"

101
00:05:25.455 --> 00:05:25.895
she asked.

102
00:05:25.915 --> 00:05:27.816
"The dungeon, probably."

103
00:05:28.616 --> 00:05:30.237
Zann told her what had just happened.

104
00:05:30.257 --> 00:05:32.278
"Oh no!"

105
00:05:32.778 --> 00:05:34.319
Fala twisted her hands together.

106
00:05:34.339 --> 00:05:35.819
"This isn't good.

107
00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:39.301
Especially given everything that's happened while you were gone."

108
00:05:40.101 --> 00:05:40.901
"What happened?"

109
00:05:41.242 --> 00:05:41.922
Perda asked.

110
00:05:41.942 --> 00:05:46.944
"For one thing, the palace guards found the Mask of Zanta in Zann's house."

111
00:05:47.772 --> 00:05:49.053
"What?" Zann cried.

112
00:05:49.073 --> 00:05:50.253
"How did it get there?

113
00:05:50.674 --> 00:05:52.115
I'm sure my parents didn't steal it!"

114
00:05:53.315 --> 00:05:55.076
"I know they didn't," Fala said.

115
00:05:55.096 --> 00:05:58.718
"But now your parents and Boz are in real trouble."

116
00:05:59.619 --> 00:06:00.459
Zann gulped.

117
00:06:00.999 --> 00:06:02.000
"What kind of trouble?"

118
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.501
"I'm not sure yet," Fala said.

119
00:06:04.521 --> 00:06:07.963
"They're being kept in the dungeon until the election is over.

120
00:06:08.543 --> 00:06:11.465
Then the new king or queen can figure out what to do."

121
00:06:11.485 --> 00:06:13.746
"What about my uncle?"

122
00:06:14.026 --> 00:06:14.627
Gliss asked.

123
00:06:14.647 --> 00:06:16.388
"Did they let him go?"

124
00:06:17.444 --> 00:06:22.286
"No. All the prisoners are staying until after the election," Fala said.

125
00:06:22.306 --> 00:06:24.646
"It's okay," Zann said.

126
00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:27.967
"At least this gives us some time to deal with Morb first.

127
00:06:28.427 --> 00:06:30.788
After all, the election is almost a month away."

128
00:06:30.808 --> 00:06:33.509
"No, it's not," Fala said.

129
00:06:33.529 --> 00:06:36.230
"That's another thing that happened while you were gone.

130
00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:40.631
Laddno is insisting on holding the election next week!"
